# The combination SPEC E2-A 10.14's E2-B entry condition is actually about, and
# which existed on no artifact before 2026-08-15: the product select ABI (which
# arms the bounded readback) plus -DOXSDK_E2_FORMAT_BARRIER, with the discovery
# ABI still exported so the A3/A4/A5 harness drives it unchanged.  Both symbol
# sets on ONE hash: the entry condition has two clauses, and satisfying them on
# two artifacts would satisfy neither.
#
# Capabilities declared: editor-discovery-closed-actions AND narrow-editor-v1.
# Without the second the worker's gate refuses every product-ABI method, so the
# recipe greps for both rather than trusting the builder.
#
# Also carries the dispatch-time selection field (SPEC E2-A 10.14 narrowing 7).
#
# Measurement profile: never shipped.  It does NOT change the discovery profile,
# which keeps pure callback semantics and keeps finding 039 by design
# (probe_engine.hpp:69-72) -- that is the ruling, not an omission.
#
# The three frozen artifacts, verified before AND after this build:
